      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Netflix :\nlets assume we are data scientist in Netflix, meeting going on \nhow to increase revenue of it.\nThere are three ways to do so:\n* getting new customers \n* charging more from the existing customer\n* somehow stopping the customers which are leaving netflix",
